==Description==
'''Survival Intermission Lobby''' is the main hub for survival modes matches entered via both [[Elevators]] and [[Matchmaking]]. It contains four panels with a random map in them, an inventory area that allows the player to access the inventory, though with some sections like crates disabled and a super computer that allows the player to override the current maps if they are a VIP.

On top of the interactable spots on the map, there are three buttons on the screen. These are veto, which if the specified number of players votes for overrides every currently selected map, ready, which instantly starts the match and inventory, which opens the inventory.

Entering the '''Survival Intermission Lobby''' through private servers gives the player access to unlimited map overrides without VIP, allows them to play on community maps and gives them unlimited vetos. However, it also adds in a 25 second timer whenever a map is overridden or all maps are vetoed.

==Appearance==
The '''Survival Intermission Lobby''' is a small island with palm trees around Multiple statues of different tower,  the map also has the armory section with bamboo decor.

There is a small armory which contains a snowman and multiple gifts. Four panels can be seen which display a map and their difficulty. Next to these panels, there is a super computer which has a statue next to it that holds a VIP tag. The last notable object on this map is the [[Leaderboard]]s, which display triumphs in survival modes in the current day and month.

